# This repository is student-facing. It contains only what someone taking the course
# needs in order to follow along: manifests, Helm values, HCL policies, scripts, sample
# app code, and the diagram PNGs the lessons embed.
#
# Course authoring material does not belong here and is not kept here. It lives in a
# separate private workspace. This file is a seatbelt, not the control: git history
# still exposes anything that was ever committed, so the rule is that authoring material
# never enters the working tree in the first place.
#
# Never in this repo: PRD or backlog exports, instructions files, internal planning
# notes, .excalidraw sources, internal QA or validation scripts, credentials, draft or
# scratch lesson content, or a solved capstone.

*.excalidraw
.taskmaster/
instructions.md
.internal/

# Local cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# Anything that looks like a credential
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
kubeconfig
*-kubeconfig.yaml
